Cell["\<\
Not specifying a Force option means that SchwarzOsculatingOrbitalElements \
uses the SchwarzGasDrag model.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7779000690584936`*^9, 3.777900089094967*^9}, {
  3.7779001480303717`*^9, 3.7779001516626043`*^9}, {3.777900207356672*^9, 
